    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Metz 1959. Michel, un respectable notaire de province et sa femme H\u00e9l\u00e8ne, qui partage son temps entre les \u0153uvres caritatives et l'\u00e9ducation de leur fils, forment un couple exemplaire. Le tableau serait banal si Michel ne dissimulait un lourd secret : tous les week-ends, il s'absente dans sa r\u00e9sidence secondaire, pour devenir Myl\u00e8ne sous le regard de Flavia, travesti exp\u00e9riment\u00e9 et ancien camarade de la dr\u00f4le de guerre. Sous son influence, le lieu devient la Villa Mimi, point de ralliement d\u2019une petite communaut\u00e9 d\u2019hommes qui jouent librement \u00e0 \u00eatre des femmes\u2026",
        "english": "Metz 1959. Michel, a respectable, provincial solicitor, and his wife H\u00e9l\u00e8ne, who keeps herself busy with charity work and educating their son, form an exemplary couple. They would make for a dull painting, if it weren't for the fact that Michel hides a dark secret: every weekend he disappears to a second home to become Myl\u00e8ne, under the watchful eye of Flavia, an experienced transvestite and former comrade from the war. Under his influence, house becomes Villa Mimi, a rallying point for a small community of men who freely act out being women..."
